@startuml Antibody Sequence Loader - Class Diagram

' Main Classes
class Clone {
  - seq_id: str
  - ai: int
  - sample_: str
  - subject_: str
  - clone_id: int
  - function: str
  - copy_nu: int
  - cdr3_aa: str
  - sequence: str
  - germline: str
  - extra_fields: dict
  - nines: list[(int, str)]
  - nine_aa_triplets: list[(int, str)]
  --
  + extract_nines(): void
  + translate_nines(): void
}

class CodonMapper {
  - amino_acid_triplets: dict
  - codon_table: dict
  --
  + translate_nine_mer(nine_mer: str): str
  + map_sequence(dna_sequence: str): Generator
}

class KmerNetwork {
  - k: int
  - store_positions: bool
  - nodes: dict
  - edges: dict
  --
  + add_kmer(kmer: str, clone_id: int, pos: int): void
  + add_sequence(sequence: str, clone_id: int): void
  + normalize_nodes(): void
  + apply_node_threshold(threshold: float): void
  + compute_edge_probabilities(): void
  + apply_edge_threshold(threshold: float): void
  + get_frequency_distribution(): dict
  + to_serializable(): dict
}

class NetworkCollection {
  - aa_network: KmerNetwork
  - nt_network: KmerNetwork
  - aa_network_region: dict
  --
  + get_aa_network(): KmerNetwork
  + get_nt_network(): KmerNetwork
}

class AntibodySequenceLoaderApp {
  - datasets: list
  - dataset_frames: list
  - clones_r1: dict
  - clones_r2: dict
  - networks_r1: NetworkCollection
  - networks_r2: NetworkCollection
  - triplet_df_r1: DataFrame
  - triplet_df_r2: DataFrame
  --
  + browse_file(index: int): void
  + analyze_dataset(index: int): void
  + execute_triplets(region_index: int): void
  + compare_datasets(): void
  + compare_areas(): void
  + update_node_threshold(value: float, label: Widget, index: int): void
  + update_edge_threshold(value: float, label: Widget, index: int): void
}

' Relationships
Clone --> CodonMapper : uses
Clone *-- "1..*" nine : contains
Clone *-- "1..*" nine_aa_triplets : contains

KmerNetwork --> CodonMapper : optionally uses
NetworkCollection *-- "1" aa_network
NetworkCollection *-- "1" nt_network
NetworkCollection *-- "2" aa_network_region

AntibodySequenceLoaderApp --> Clone : processes
AntibodySequenceLoaderApp --> NetworkCollection : creates/manages
AntibodySequenceLoaderApp --> KmerNetwork : analyzes

' Utility Functions
package "Utility Functions" {
  class LoadClones <<function>> {
    + load_clones(csv_file: str): dict
  }
  
  class BuildTripletDF <<function>> {
    + build_triplet_df(clones: dict): DataFrame
  }
  
  class ComputeDistance <<function>> {
    + compute_network_distance(net1: KmerNetwork, net2: KmerNetwork): float
  }
  
  class SaveEdges <<function>> {
    + save_edges_to_csv(network: KmerNetwork, output_path: str, ...): str
  }
  
  class PlotNetwork <<function>> {
    + plot_from_aa_network(network: KmerNetwork, ...): str
  }
}

AntibodySequenceLoaderApp ..> LoadClones : uses
AntibodySequenceLoaderApp ..> BuildTripletDF : uses
AntibodySequenceLoaderApp ..> ComputeDistance : uses
AntibodySequenceLoaderApp ..> SaveEdges : uses
AntibodySequenceLoaderApp ..> PlotNetwork : uses

note right of KmerNetwork
  Core data structure for 
  storing k-mers (3-mers or 9-mers)
  with frequency and co-occurrence data
end note

note right of Clone
  Represents an antibody clone
  with sequence data and methods
  for k-mer extraction
end note

@enduml
